msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「Oh, Ryuuji. What is it?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, Ryuuji. ¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You live here in this condo?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Vives aquí en este departamento?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「This condo is really modern! Your＿parents must be rich.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Este departamento es muy moderno!＿Tus padres deben ser ricos.」"

msgid "Taiga「Not really...... It's not that big of a deal.」"
msgstr "Taiga「En realidad no...... No es para tanto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It IS a big deal, compared to my＿family's apartment. You seem to be＿lacking in perspective......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「SÍ es para tanto, comparado con el＿departamento de mi familia. Parece＿que te falta perspectiva......」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut up! Be quiet, you mongrel!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cállate! ¡Silencio, perro mestizo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why are you so touchy?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué eres tan susceptible?」"

msgid "Taiga「What? Your insensitivity alone is a＿CRIME! Shall I convict you!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué? ¡Tu sola insensibilidad ya es un＿DELITO! ¡¿Quieres que te condene?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Me, insensitive? I was just envying you,＿you know?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Yo, insensible? Solo te＿tenía envidia, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Oh yeah, you don't remember＿anything...... Tch.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Ah, claro, no recuerdas＿nada...... Tch.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Inside...... Well, maybe your parents are＿home......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Adentro...... Bueno, tal vez tus＿padres estén en casa......」"

msgid "Taiga「You...... Didn't I tell you that I live＿alone?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oye...... ¿No te dije que vivo sola?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, I see! Now I get it. So that's why＿you come over to eat with us!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡Ah, ya veo! Ahora lo entiendo.＿¡Por eso vienes a comer con nosotros!」"

msgid "Taiga「You remembered?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Lo recordaste?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, it explains why you're no good at＿housework...... Hm? Then...... your family＿situation is really complicated!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, eso explica que seas mala con los＿quehaceres...... ¿Mmm? Entonces......＿¡¿tu situación familiar es complicada?!」"

msgid "Taiga「......It's not all that \"complicated.\"」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Tampoco es tan \"complicada\".」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Let's go up to your house already! I＿mean, please let me!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Subamos ya a tu casa! Digo,＿¡por favor déjame pasar!」"

msgid "Taiga「O-Okay......」"
msgstr "Taiga「E-Está bien......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sure enough...... It's just as I expected.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Lo sabía...... Justo lo que esperaba.」"

msgid "Taiga「What are you grinning about? It's＿creepy!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿De qué te ríes así? ¡Das escalofríos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well～ It's outrageously messy in here.＿Is this really a girl's room?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno～ Esto está muy desordenado. ¿En＿serio es el cuarto de una chica?」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, I was pretty busy while YOU were＿in the hospital, so it couldn't be helped,＿you know!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, estuve muy ocupada mientras＿TÚ estabas en el hospital, ¡así que＿no se pudo evitar, ¿sabes?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't make excuses. I remember＿perfectly well the state your room gets＿if you neglect it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No pongas excusas. Recuerdo＿perfectamente cómo se pone tu＿cuarto si lo descuidas.」"

msgid "Taiga「You're just a perfectionist. Girls' rooms＿are all like this.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Solo eres un perfeccionista. Todos＿los cuartos de chicas son así.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I admit I like things to be orderly, but＿it's rude to compare everyone else's＿rooms to this.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Admito que me gusta el orden, pero＿es una falta de respeto comparar los＿cuartos de las demás con esto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Anyway, it doesn't matter! Let's start＿cleaning your room!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡En fin, no importa! ¡Empecemos＿a limpiar tu cuarto!」"

msgid "Taiga「Hey, wait......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oye, espera......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「First, we put these scattered things＿back where they belong......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Primero, ponemos estas cosas esparcidas＿de vuelta en su lugar......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Stationery goes in this drawer, and＿accessories go...... here. I seem to recall＿a jewelry box...... Oh, here it is.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Los útiles van en este cajón, y los＿accesorios...... aquí. Creo recordar＿un joyero...... Ah, aquí está.」"

msgid "Taiga「......You know where everything is?＿Even I'm not sure most of the time.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Sabes dónde va todo? Ni yo estoy＿segura la mayoría del tiempo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's not really \"knowing\" so much as it＿is \"remembering\" being in this room.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No es tanto \"saber\" como \"recordar\"＿haber estado en este cuarto.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hey Ryuuji, earlier you remembered＿that I'm bad at chores and live by＿myself, right?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oye, Ryuuji, hace rato recordaste＿que soy mala con los quehaceres＿y que vivo sola, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Taiga「Anything else? Did you remember any＿other related stuff?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Algo más? ¿Recordaste alguna＿otra cosa relacionada?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Let's see...... Oh, I remembered the very＿first time I came up here.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A ver...... Ah, recordé la primera＿vez que subí aquí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I seem to recall the kitchen sink being＿overly dirty, so I cleaned it...... Oh no, is＿the kitchen island okay!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Creo recordar que el fregadero estaba＿demasiado sucio, así que lo limpié......＿¡Oh no! ¿La isla de la cocina está bien?」"

msgid "Taiga「Calm down. I never use it, so it's＿untouched.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cálmate. Nunca la uso,＿así que está intacta.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see. I have mixed feelings about＿abandoning it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo. Tengo sentimientos encontrados＿por haberla abandonado.」"

msgid "Taiga「*Sigh*...... Your memories are always＿about chores, aren't they...... Whatever,＿keep going.」"
msgstr "Taiga「*Suspiro*...... Tus recuerdos siempre＿son sobre los quehaceres, ¿no......?＿Como sea, sigue.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Argh, your dirty clothes are＿everywhere. You should put them in＿the washing machine...... Ohh!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Argh, tu ropa sucia está por todas＿partes. Deberías meterla en la＿lavadora...... ¡¿Ehh?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Why, Taiga, would you leave your＿underwear laying around......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Por qué, Taiga, dejarías tu ropa＿interior tirada por ahí......?）」"

msgid "Taiga「What?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, it's just...... How do I put it......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, es que...... ¿Cómo decirlo......?」"

msgid "Taiga「What is...... Aahh!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué pasa......? ¡Aahh!」"

msgid "Taiga「Y-Y-Y-You...... D-D-Did you see...... that?」"
msgstr "Taiga「T-T-T-Tú...... ¿V-V-Viste...... eso?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I didn't really \"see\" it. More like \"caught＿a glimpse\".」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En realidad no la \"vi\". Más bien＿la \"alcancé a ver de reojo\".」"

msgid "Taiga「Y-You horndog, libido wizard, dirty＿little pork bun!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡P-Pervertido, mago de la lujuria,＿sucio bollo de cerdo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「OW! It shouldn't be left lying around in＿the first place!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡AU! ¡Para empezar, no debería＿estar tirada por ahí!」"

msgid "Taiga「SHUT UP! Delete it from your memory＿right now!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡CÁLLATE! ¡Bórralo de tu＿memoria ahora mismo!」"

msgid "Taiga「I know! Go back to amnesia!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ya sé! ¡Vuelve a tener amnesia!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't be absurd! Hurry up and put＿your underwear away!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No seas absurda! ¡Apúrate y＿guarda tu ropa interior!」"

msgid "Taiga「Listen to your master, stupid dog! Face＿that way!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Obedece a tu ama, perro estúpido!＿¡Mira hacia allá!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay, okay. I'll clean up over here,＿then.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien, está bien. Entonces＿limpiaré por aquí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Fufufu...... It's perfect!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Jejeje...... ¡Está perfecto!」"

msgid "Taiga「Satisfied?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Satisfecho?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Not yet. There are still plenty of rooms＿to go!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Todavía no. ¡Aún quedan muchas＿habitaciones por limpiar!」"

msgid "Taiga「*Sigh*...... Why don't you do it yourself?＿I've had enough.」"
msgstr "Taiga「*Suspiro*...... ¿Por qué no lo haces＿tú solo? Ya tuve suficiente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tú......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......No, it's more convenient with Taiga＿out of the way! Fufufu...... I'll do it!＿Thoroughly!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......No, ¡es más práctico sin＿Taiga estorbando! Jejeje......＿¡Lo haré! ¡A fondo!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Just as Taiga said, the kitchen is still＿clean. The living room isn't bad＿compared to the bedroom, but......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Tal como dijo Taiga, la cocina sigue＿limpia. La sala no está mal comparada＿con el dormitorio, pero......）」"

msgid "Go to a different room"
msgstr "Ir a otra habitación"

msgid "Clean here anyway"
msgstr "Limpiar aquí de todos modos"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Unfortunately, this is not the place to＿focus my efforts. I'll go to a different＿room.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Por desgracia, este no es el lugar＿donde centrar mis esfuerzos. Iré＿a otra habitación.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（No, even though it's hard to see at first＿glance, living areas can be surprisingly＿messy. I'll clean up here.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No, aunque no se note de entrada,＿la sala puede estar muy sucia.＿Limpiaré aquí.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Oho?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......¿Oh?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（A girls' fashion magazine...... It's last＿month's issue...... Maybe it's important＿to Taiga?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Una revista de moda femenina......＿Es el número del mes pasado......＿¿Será importante para Taiga?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Aha. I recognize the girl on the＿cover......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Ajá. Reconozco a la chica＿de la portada......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Oh, I know. It's Kawashima Ami from＿yesterday. That's right, she was asked＿to autograph a magazine......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ah, ya sé. Es Kawashima Ami, la＿de ayer. Sí, le pidieron que＿autografiara una revista......）」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, you found it. I was wondering＿where it was.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, la encontraste. Me preguntaba＿dónde estaba.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, I met the girl on the cover＿yesterday. Is she a classmate or＿something?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga, ayer conocí a la chica＿de la portada. ¿Es compañera＿de clase o algo así?」"

msgid "Taiga「I don't know how you'd refer to her, but＿to me, yeah.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No sé cómo la llamarías＿tú, pero para mí, sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「She's cute. I guess she is a model after＿all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es linda. Supongo que es＿modelo después de todo.」"

msgid "Taiga「If you're that interested in it, I'll let you＿have it. Even useless stuff is good if it＿helps you remember.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si tanto te interesa, te la regalo.＿Hasta las cosas inútiles sirven＿si te ayudan a recordar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You've got a point there.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Tienes razón en eso.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Shouldn't you keep cleaning? It's＿getting dark out.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿No deberías seguir limpiando?＿Ya está oscureciendo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, you're right.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, tienes razón.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Oho?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Oh?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Convenience store food wrappers......＿Seems her diet was pretty awful while I＿was hospitalized.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Envoltorios de comida de tienda de＿conveniencia...... Parece que su dieta＿fue pésima mientras estuve internado.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I understand you had no choice, but＿don't leave trash around after you＿eat...... Wash it, then recycle it!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Sé que no tenías opción, pero＿no dejes basura tras comer......＿¡Lávala y recíclala!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Oh.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Ah.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Anyway, this goes with the flammable＿garbage. My apologies to the＿rainforest......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（En fin, esto va con la basura＿incinerable. Mis disculpas a＿la selva tropical......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Guess this room is just about done.＿Next......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Supongo que esta habitación ya＿casi está lista. Ahora......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（The restroom...... Now then, where to＿start.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（El baño...... Ahora bien,＿por dónde empezar.）」"

msgid "Leave it as is"
msgstr "Dejarlo así"

msgid "Clean it"
msgstr "Limpiarlo"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I don't want to run the risk of seeing＿more underwear, so I can live without＿cleaning in there. I'll leave it as is.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No quiero arriesgarme a ver más ropa＿interior, así que puedo vivir sin＿limpiar ahí dentro. Lo dejaré así.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taigaaa, cleaning's dooone!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Taigaaa, ya terminé de limpiaaar!」"

msgid "Taiga「Okay, thanks. Now make some tea.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, gracias. Ahora prepara té.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「A normal person would say \"I'll make＿some tea\"......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Una persona normal diría \"Yo＿preparo el té\"......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Moisture collects easily in here, so it＿could easily become a breeding ground＿for mold. Alright, I'll clean it!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Aquí se acumula humedad, así＿que el moho crece con facilidad.＿¡Muy bien, lo limpiaré!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Oho?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......¿Oh?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What is this thing......? It's sort of＿hill-shaped......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Qué es esta cosa......? Tiene＿forma como de colina......）」"

msgid "Taiga「Hey you, what do you think you're＿staring at?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oye tú, ¿qué te crees que estás mirando?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Is this something I shouldn't＿stare at?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿Es algo que no debería mirar?」"

msgid "Taiga「I-It's not really bad to look at, but......」"
msgstr "Taiga「N-No es que sea malo mirarlo, pero......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What IS this thing?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué ES esta cosa?」"

msgid "Taiga「......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I need your help to regain my＿memories, you know. Tell me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Necesito tu ayuda para recuperar＿mis recuerdos, ¿sabes? Dime.」"

msgid "Taiga「......est......pa......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......moha......pe......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「It's a chest pad!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Es una almohadilla para el pecho!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「A chest pad!? For what?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Almohadilla para el pecho?! ¿Para qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「Last year during pool season, you＿sewed these into my bathing suit.」"
msgstr "Taiga「El año pasado en temporada de piscina,＿tú cosiste estas en mi traje de baño.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why on earth would...... Oh. Never mind,＿I get it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué diablos......? Ah.＿No importa, ya entendí.」"

msgid "Taiga「And just what part do you \"get\"!?＿Naughty dog, dirty dog!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Y exactamente qué parte \"entendiste\"?!＿¡Perro travieso, perro sucio!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I can't help but understand now. I see,＿so that's what happened. I'll just put＿this......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es imposible no entenderlo ahora.＿Ya veo, así que eso pasó. Voy＿a guardar esto......」"

msgid "Taiga「You don't have to put it back! I don't＿want it now that your perv-slime on＿your perv-finger perv-groped it!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No tienes que guardarla! ¡Ya no la＿quiero ahora que la baba pervertida de＿tus dedos pervertidos la manoseó!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I sewed it in the first place, so I would＿think my perv-slime on my perv-finger＿already perv-groped it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo la cosí en primer lugar, así que＿supongo que la baba pervertida de mis＿dedos pervertidos ya la había manoseado.」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut your perv-mouth, you＿perv-minion! And take that with you!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cierra tu boca pervertida, esbirro＿pervertido! ¡Y llévate eso contigo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? But if I take this one, you'll be＿lopsided......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? Pero si me llevo esta,＿quedarás dispareja......」"

msgid "Taiga「That was just a spare, so I'll be fine!＿Don't get any weird ideas, you dirty＿mongrel!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Solo era de repuesto, así que＿estaré bien! ¡No te hagas ideas＿raras, sucio perro mestizo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just what am I going to do with＿this......? Well, I guess I'll hold on to it＿for now......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y qué voy a hacer yo con esto......?＿Bueno, supongo que la guardaré＿por ahora......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......What's this?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......¿Qué es esto?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「AAAAARGH!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡AAAAARGH!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......I, I'll throw it away. And then I'll＿pretend I never saw it. That's crucial.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......L-Lo tiraré y fingiré que nunca＿lo vi. Eso es fundamental.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Couldn't find anything......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No pude encontrar nada......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Alright, I'll leave it at that. Moving＿on.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Bien, lo dejaré así. Sigamos.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Oh, I'm back to this room again. I only＿just tidied up in here......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ah, volví a esta habitación otra vez.＿Apenas acabo de ordenar aquí......）」"

msgid "Call it a day"
msgstr "Dejarlo por hoy"

msgid "Clean it one more time"
msgstr "Limpiar una vez más"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Eh, I think it's fine to call it a day.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Eh, creo que lo dejaré por hoy.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......No! My instinct is telling me if I clean＿again I'll find something! I'll clean one＿more time!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......¡No! Mi instinto me dice que,＿si limpio de nuevo, encontraré algo.＿¡Limpiaré una vez más!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Hm, what's this?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Hm, ¿qué es esto?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（\"Official Record: Japan's Archipelago＿of Horror\"......? What's this DVD......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（\"Registro oficial: Japón,＿archipiélago del terror\"......＿¿Qué DVD es......?）」"

msgid "Taiga「Well well, where did you find that＿subpar DVD?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Vaya, vaya, ¿dónde encontraste＿ese DVD de mala calidad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It was under your pillow.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Estaba debajo de tu almohada.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ugh, seriously? No wonder I've been＿having nightmares......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ugh, ¿en serio? Con razón he estado＿teniendo pesadillas......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What kind of DVD is this?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué clase de DVD es este?」"

msgid "Taiga「You can tell just from the cover, can't＿you? Wait, didn't we watch it together＿once before?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Se nota con solo ver la portada, ¿no?＿Espera, ¿no lo vimos juntos una vez?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wow, no kidding......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Vaya, no me digas......」"

msgid "Taiga「It might help you remember＿something, so I'll give it to you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tal vez te ayude a recordar＿algo, así que te lo doy.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh? Oh, thanks.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? Ah, gracias.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（To be honest, this isn't really＿something I want to keep in my room,＿but...... I'll accept her kindness.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（A decir verdad, esto no es algo que＿quiera tener en mi cuarto, pero......＿Aceptaré su amabilidad.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......I was right...... There's still some＿things to be picked up.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Tenía razón...... Aún＿hay cosas que recoger.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（A clothing tag. The price was......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Etiqueta de ropa. El precio era......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（............）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（............）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（This one thing would pay half of our＿monthly living expenses. Maybe a＿whole month if we were careful......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Esta sola prenda pagaría medio mes＿de nuestros gastos. Tal vez un mes＿entero si ahorráramos......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（No use thinking about it. To the＿garbage with you!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（De nada sirve pensarlo.＿¡A la basura contigo!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Couldn't find anything......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No pude encontrar nada......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Well, this should be good for now.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Bueno, ya basta por ahora.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taigaaa, cleaning's dooone!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Taigaaa, ya terminé de limpiaaar!」"

msgid "Taiga「Okay, thanks. Now make some tea.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, gracias. Ahora prepara té.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「A normal person would say \"I'll make＿some tea\"......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Una persona normal diría \"Yo＿preparo el té\"......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（No matter how much I want to tidy up,＿I can't touch that...... Wait, I'm pretty＿calm about this......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Por muchas ganas que tenga de ordenar,＿no puedo tocar eso...... Espera, estoy＿bastante tranquilo con esto......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Maybe it's something I'm used to＿doing?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Será algo que estoy＿acostumbrado a hacer?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Dirty disposable chopsticks...... Damn it＿Taiga, if you're eating in your own＿house, use your own chopsticks!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Palillos desechables sucios......＿Maldita sea, Taiga, si comes en tu＿propia casa, ¡usa tus propios palillos!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（And you should always carry personal＿chopsticks around with you!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Y siempre deberías llevar contigo＿tus palillos personales!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（At first glance it's like a mossball, but a＿mossball wouldn't be in a bathroom.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（De entrada parece una bola de musgo,＿pero una no estaría en el baño.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（So it's just a thing with green stuff＿growing on it......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Entonces, ¿es solo una cosa con algo＿verde creciéndole encima......?）」"

msgid "Taiga「It was in a bargain bin at the mall＿during the year-end sale, so I bought it＿to watch it with Minorin.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Estaba en la cesta de ofertas de fin＿de año del centro comercial, así que＿lo compré para verlo con Minorin.」"

msgid "Taiga「But at some point it disappeared.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Pero en algún momento desapareció.」"
